# Load-bearing rules for design:heuristic-eval.
# Nielsen's ten heuristics are a published external standard and live in
# references/. What must not drift is how findings are scored and reported.

evaluates against Nielsen's ten heuristics :: Nielsen
severity scale is used to rank findings :: severity|Severity
critical issues are called out separately :: [Cc]ritical
findings cite the screen or flow they were found in :: screen|flow
